                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;">
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> </strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一段铭刻青春岁月的高中生活在今天完美落幕，</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一个承载未来梦想的生命节点从此刻奔向更美好的远方。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong> </strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2021年6月21日上午，我校隆重举行了主题为“未来自定义，后浪竞奔逐”的2021届高三毕业典礼。党委书记、校长王琛，党委副书记、纪委书记孙洪亮，副校长蒋明，副校长俞奇弘，全体高三师生，高三家长代表及我校后勤工作人员代表参加了本次典礼。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>党委书记、校长王琛致辞</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">首先，党委书记、校长王琛在典礼上作《启程远方，傲迎未来》主题的讲话，向2021届毕业生表达了诚挚祝福和殷殷期盼。王校长送给毕业生们四句话：</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>一是“要学会判断、明确方向”，</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">将自身成长与时代发展，民族复兴紧密连接；</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>二是“要完善自我，奋然前行”，</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">父母、老师、同学、亲友和一中大家庭永远是前行路上最厚实的支持；</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>三是“要一路求真，追求博雅”，</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">坚守一中人“求真知、觅真理、做真人”的态度和精神，坚守一中赋予的“博”的立场和“雅”的情怀；</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>四是“要敢于担当，懂得感恩”，</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">胸怀家国，不忘感恩，与共产党人“不忘初心，心系天下”的情怀同行。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> <img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/7/202107051052023697.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202107051052023697.jpg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>教师代表发言</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">接着，教师代表朱谷兰老师发言，由《西游记》唐僧扫塔引出关于人生的十二字隐喻：</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>“起点低”</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">提醒同学们放低姿态，谦虚求教；</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>“当下净”</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教导同学们应全力以赴，踏实做事；</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>“回头脏”</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">敦促同学们不断进步，赢得未来；</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>“平常道”</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">要求同学们学会反思，懂得领悟。认真完成每一件小事也是一种修行，朱老师希望同学们修炼自我，走出自己的“平常道”。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> <img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/7/202107051052147798.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202107051052147798.jpg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>家长代表发言</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">虞程阳的妈妈母亲赵琴女士代表全体高三学生家长发言，向为孩子成长用心良苦，辛勤付出的一中老师和工作人员们表示由衷的感谢。作为家长，她希望孩子们带着一中的求真、务实、创新和一中人的美德，担起家庭和社会的责任，用一往无前的魄力和毅力，不断拼搏，铸就光辉灿烂的人生。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> <img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/7/202107051052260269.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202107051052260269.jpg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>学生代表发言</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高三（3）班路北南同学作为学生代表发言。他说，毕业后走出校门的他不要整齐划一的人生，而将承载着最富挑战也最具希望和梦想的这三年，去追求不同的，属于自己的，充满意义的生活，耐心找寻最适合自己的节奏，感恩自己，相信自己，奏响最动听的独奏之声。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/7/202107051052410283.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202107051052410283.jpg" /> </strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>2021届优秀学生表彰</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">校领导为优秀学生颁发各项德育先进荣誉证书。</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="color: #000000;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/7/202107051053439241.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202107051053439241.jpg" /> </strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>颁发毕业证书</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">校领导及高三任课教师为各班颁发毕业证书，并合影留念。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> <strong style="font-family: 宋体; text-align: center; white-space: normal;"><img src="http://10.176.17.2/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/7/202107051053062636.jpg" title="202107051053062636.jpg" style="max-width: 100%;" /></strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong style="font-family: 宋体; text-align: center; white-space: normal;"></strong></span></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/7/202107051054142049.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202107051054142049.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/7/202107051054145946.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202107051054145946.jpg" /><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/7/202107051054156291.jpg" title="202107051054156291.jpg" style="max-width: 100%;" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/7/202107051054155703.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202107051054155703.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/7/202107051054150023.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202107051054150023.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/7/202107051054150077.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202107051054150077.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/7/202107051054162271.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202107051054162271.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/7/202107051054161757.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202107051054161757.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/7/202107051054163031.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202107051054163031.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/7/202107051054167909.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202107051054167909.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/7/202107051054178969.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202107051054178969.jpg" /><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/7/202107051054171111.jpg" title="202107051054171111.jpg" style="max-width: 100%;" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/7/202107051054178194.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202107051054178194.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/7/202107051056223169.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202107051056223169.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/7/202107051054181736.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202107051054181736.jpg" /></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong style="font-family: 宋体; text-align: center; white-space: normal;">
</strong></span>
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>感恩母校</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“将盛夏的晚霞和诗意年华装进行囊，</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">经汗水浸透的终生收获一一叠放，</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">不说再见，我们故作坚强，</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">带不走的，那就留给时光，</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">绍兴一中，等我们回家”</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">罗佳妮</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">陈金凤</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">等同学用一首原创诗歌——《少年又远方》，深情表达</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">对老师真诚的感恩之心，对母校浓浓的眷恋之情。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">带着这份感恩，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">各班班长</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">作为代表</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">为全体高三班主任</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、部分</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">任课老师及</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学校后勤工作人员</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">献</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">花</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">感谢他们在成长路上的陪伴和无私奉献。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">毕业典礼前，我校还开展了“我向母校赠一言”活动，向毕业生征集对于陪伴三年的母校想说的话。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">我们收到了对母校的点赞和祝福：</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><em>“在这里的三年真的好开心～在这里get到了许多可可爱爱的日常～当年觉得平平凡凡的事，到了毕业前就变得无比珍贵。真心希望绍兴一中越办越好啊！”</em></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><em>“大一中，遇见你我好幸运！！！”</em></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><em>“时光荏苒，岁月如梭。愿光阴永驻，愿在未来仰望星空时，心头仍回响一中的博雅求真！愿一中永盛，直攀巅峰！”</em></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><em>......</em></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">也收到了对母校的意见和建议：</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><em>“希望食堂的饭菜能再多样化一点。我的粉丝煲，我的烧烤，我的焗饭，我的豆腐小笼…快回来吧！虽然我吃不到了，希望他们可以吃到。”</em></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><em>“能不能想个办法在体育馆这侧风雨走廊和食堂这侧的风雨走廊连起来？虽然不太现实，但是高三每次下雨回寝室都要被淋。”</em></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><em>“建议宿舍早上起床音乐安排上！”</em></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><em>......</em></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">相信在同学们的赠言鞭策下，一中会越来越好！</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/7/202107051056586284.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202107051056586284.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/7/202107051056583950.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202107051056583950.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/7/202107051056580340.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202107051056580340.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/7/202107051056594710.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202107051056594710.jpg" /></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span>
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>毕业祝福</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一中的老师们，工作人员们，和毕业的学长学姐们为本届毕业生们送去了最诚挚的祝福。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>合唱</strong></span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>校歌</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: left;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">蕺山风高，姚江流长</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">......</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">,全体师生共同合唱的《绍兴一中校歌》，希望高三学子们能“承前启后，努力精进”，开创属于自己的无限可能。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">本次典礼上，同学们还带来了精彩的歌舞节目，为高中三年添上最后一抹亮色。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">今天，你们是背上行囊，奔赴远方的一中学子，</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">明天，你们是胸怀理想，勇担责任的社会栋梁；</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">今天，你们聚集在这里，告别陪伴三年的母校，</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">明天，你们要定义未来，掀起民族复兴的巨浪！</span></p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-family: Calibri;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">祝愿高三全体同学毕业快乐，前程似锦！</span></p><p style="font-family: Microsoft YaHei UI;font-size: 9.5pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-size: 9.5pt;letter-spacing: 1.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/7/202107051057261500.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202107051057261500.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/7/202107051057266481.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202107051057266481.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/7/202107051057261890.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202107051057261890.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/7/202107051057265366.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202107051057265366.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/7/202107051057263734.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202107051057263734.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/7/202107051057263681.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202107051057263681.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/7/202107051057265014.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202107051057265014.jpg" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2021/7/202107051057267804.jpg" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202107051057267804.jpg" /></p><p style="font-family: Microsoft YaHei UI;font-size: 9.5pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="background: #FFFFFF;color: #000000;font-size: 9.5pt;letter-spacing: 1.2pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span>
</p><p style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12pt;line-height: 150.0%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.33in;"><span style="color: #000000;font-size: 12pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p>
    
